## Capture-Fix Receipt Contract

On 2026-06-10, `dream.backfill-run-receipt.v1` gained `captureFixResults`.

Reason:

- `dream.backfill-plan.v1` already had `captureFixes`, but the run receipt only reported derived-index backfill action results.
- That made it too easy for a Dream report to blur two different problems: "the derived index is stale" and "the capture path is broken."
- The contract now reports index backfill action results and capture-fix results separately. This supports the core rule that backfill is recovery, not normal operation.

Changed surfaces:

- `src/app/workflow-nodes/dream-memory-fabric-schemas.ts` adds typed `captureFixResults` to `DreamBackfillRunReceiptDocumentSchema`, defaulting to `[]` so old receipts still parse when they had no capture fixes.
- `src/cartridges/dream-memory-fabric/trusted-local-memory-fabric.ts` emits capture-fix results from planned capture fixes without mutating source systems.
- `src/app/infrastructure/memory-adapters.ts` does the same for the integration fixture adapter.
- `src/app/workflow-nodes/dream-memory-fabric.ts` turns skipped, blocked, or failed capture-fix results into `capture-ingest-fix` refinement proposals and reports capture-fix counts in the HITL MDSvX proof section.
- `scripts/trusted-local-dream-memory-relay-proof.ts` records capture-fix blocked/completed/failed/skipped counts in the local proof receipt.
- `scripts/workflow-app-dream-preflight.ts` now fails local proof validation when planned capture fixes do not have matching capture-fix run receipt counts.
- `scripts/workflow-app-dream-relay-provisioning-preflight.ts` carries capture-fix counts into the relay provisioning preflight summary.

Validation:

- `pnpm exec vitest run tests/integration/dream-memory-fabric-contract.test.ts tests/integration/trusted-local-dream-memory-fabric.test.ts tests/integration/trusted-local-dream-memory-relay-http.test.ts tests/integration/cloudflare-dream-memory-fabric-relay.test.ts tests/integration/trusted-dream-memory-relay-server.test.ts tests/integration/dream-live-preflight.test.ts tests/integration/dream-relay-provisioning-preflight.test.ts tests/integration/workflow-app.test.ts` passed: `8` files, `61` tests.

This still does not complete Dreaming. It tightens the relay-side recovery evidence so the eventual Cloudflare-generated Dream can distinguish stale indexes from broken capture paths.

