This is still not the final Dream definition of done. The relay adapter and workflow-node adapter are real seams, but the repo still needs an actual trusted relay deployment/config, leased memory/search/hydration/correlation/backfill capabilities, artifact-backed cartridge install/verification, and a Worker run whose `workflow.execution-proof.v1` status is `cloudflare-generated-machine-executed`.

## Workflow Cartridge Invocation Proof Receipt

On 2026-06-09, the generic workflow-node path gained an artifact-backed cartridge proof contract.

Decision:

