- `package.json` exposes `pnpm app:dream:relay:provisioning-preflight`.
- `tests/integration/dream-relay-provisioning-preflight.test.ts` proves the gate blocks without sign-off, rejects `--approval-ref` alone, rejects non-matching sign-off text, can become ready-for-approved-provisioning with the exact sign-off plus local proof/tooling, blocks if the local relay proof is missing, and proves the provisioning plan is non-executed.

