- `src/app/infrastructure/cloudflare-worker-route.ts` wires the configured Dream relay into both fabric and retrieval ports.
- `src/app/infrastructure/cloudflare-package-seeder.ts` and `tests/integration/workflow-app-fixtures.ts` add package exports for search/hydration/correlation.
- `tests/integration/workflow-app.test.ts` proves generated Dream search/hydration/correlation steps run through artifact-backed cartridge proof before normal review work.
