## Dream Relay Lease Sidecar Proof Receipt

On 2026-06-10, Dream proof gained per-node relay lease sidecar evidence.

Decision:

- `DreamMemoryFabricResult` can now carry a redacted `dream.memory-relay` lease receipt returned by the trusted relay.
- Relay-backed Dream workflow nodes write their normal typed document plus `dream/relay-lease-receipts/<stepId>.json` when the relay returns a lease receipt.
- `workflow.execution-proof.v1` now records generic `workflowNodeOutputRefs`. This is not Dream logic in the runner; it is the runner saying which artifacts the generated workflow emitted.
- `dream.generated-workflow-proof.v1` now records `relayLeaseReceiptRefs` and checks `execution:relay-lease-sidecars`.
- If execution claims `cloudflare-generated-machine-executed`, the Dream proof fails unless every relay-backed generated Dream step has a matching relay lease sidecar. Local integration runs may still verify the generated plan/machine/harness chain, but they remain `not-proven-local-integration` and show zero relay sidecars.
- This closes another fake-proof gap: a live Cloudflare Dream run cannot claim "real relay-backed memory fabric" while emitting only the generated machine proof and primary Dream documents.

Changed surfaces:

- `src/app/infrastructure/cloudflare-dream-memory-fabric-relay.ts` preserves the relay response lease receipt instead of discarding it.
- `src/app/workflow-nodes/dream-memory-fabric.ts` writes relay lease sidecar artifacts for inventory, source-health, backfill-plan, backfill-run, memory-search, hydrate, and correlate nodes.
- `src/app/domain/schemas.ts` adds `workflowNodeOutputRefs` to `workflow.execution-proof.v1`.
- `src/app/application/workflow-app.ts` populates `workflowNodeOutputRefs` from generated workflow execution artifacts.
- `src/app/workflow-nodes/dream-generated-workflow-proof.ts` fails Cloudflare Dream proof when relay-backed step sidecars are missing.
- `tests/integration/cloudflare-dream-memory-fabric-relay.test.ts` proves every relay operation returns a used redacted lease receipt without leaking the bearer token.
- `tests/integration/workflow-app.test.ts` proves local Dream integration has no relay sidecars and that a proof forged to Cloudflare status fails on `execution:relay-lease-sidecars`.

