## Dream Live Run Request Harness Receipt

On 2026-06-09, the repo gained a non-exposure live Dream run harness.

Decision:

- `pnpm app:dream:run` prepares a typed `workflow.dream-live-run-request.v1` receipt and a typed `WorkflowRunRequest`.
- The generated request asks the real Worker `POST /runs` path to run `workflow/dream-memory-fabric` as a Cloudflare-generated dynamic workflow, with Wzrrd publishing approved by actor role `wzrrd.publish`.
- The request explicitly requires the Dream cartridge node sequence: `joelclaw.dream.source-inventory`, `joelclaw.dream.source-health`, `joelclaw.dream.backfill-plan`, `joelclaw.dream.memory-search`, `joelclaw.dream.hydrate`, `joelclaw.dream.correlate`, and `joelclaw.dream.hitl-report`.
- The request tells the planner to generate `workflow.xstate-machine.v1` plus harness source before execution, prove Cloudflare executed those artifacts, search 24h/7d/30d/quarter/all-time horizons, require native Pi/Codex/Claude/Cloudflare coverage or explicit missing/false-positive language, and publish `dream/hitl-report.mdsvx` as Wzrrd `report.mdsvx`.
- `--submit` is guarded by `workflow.live-preflight.v1`. If preflight is blocked, the harness writes the request/receipt but does not call the live Worker.
- This is not a live Dream execution proof. It is the prepared handoff to live execution once the trusted relay URL/token/config/healthz gates pass.

