## Dream Support Source Coverage Receipt

On 2026-06-10, `support` moved from an explicit missing source family to a captured trusted relay source family.

Decision:

- Support coverage should start from read-only local support receipts, not live Front mutation or broad customer-data scraping.
- The first support source root is AIHero's local Front snapshot receipt store under `.brain/data/aih-triage-ingest/front-snapshot`.
- The source is marked `customer-private`. It proves authority/freshness to the trusted relay without exposing raw local paths to Cloudflare or publishing customer content.
- A missing support derived index remains recovery work. Capturing the authority source is not the same as claiming the support retrieval index is fresh.
- This did not expose the relay, start a tunnel, publish a relay URL, call live Front, send/archive/assign messages, or hand Cloudflare raw support data.

