## Open Questions

- Should QMD be installed and dogfooded as the first local Brain/transcript index, or should we implement the same collection/query shape against JoelClaw/Typesense first?
- Should org dreams be separate scheduled runs per org/project, or one system dream with org-scoped subgraphs?
- What is the default retention/expiry policy for Cloudflare-returned transcripts and observability packs?
- Which Slack/GitHub/support scopes are allowed for a system dream versus a `badass-courses` org dream?
- Does every node in the Joel Hooks system report to the same memory fabric, or do some nodes report only to project/org-local memories with rollup summaries?
